{"name":"Sun-Blessed Fire","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make a Melee Attack, but convert all Damage to Fire. On a True Hit, the Target also becomes Ignited.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"11_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"7cf0366da9194376","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Dragon Breath","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"You spew either Fire, Cold or Lightning in a 3 Unit Cone, dealing 1d4 Damage for each Level. Roll a 1d12 plus half of your Level for the Attack Check against a Contested Resilience Check. This ability can be used three times per day.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"1_a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"5e5b8758158b4f00","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Nebulous Eyes","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"Your eyes glow hazy and dark with the power of the cosmos. For the next minute, you gain Truevision and a 1d4 Bonus to Resistance.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"10_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"620fa87b252a46d3","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Burrow","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You burrow into soft ground such as loose rocks, dirt, snow or sand and move up to 3 Units. While Burrowed in this way, you have a Burrow Speed equal to your Movement Speed and do not leave any noticeable marks on your entry point. This Action can be used again to Unburrow.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"19_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"7794d096d9244445","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Gnoll Bite","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make an Unarmed Attack by biting a Creature and tasting its blood, dealing 1d10 extra Damage on a hit. If the attack hits and the Creature has blood, you learn its Physical and Elemental Mitigations.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"14_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"62f82afc589d4ed2","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Gnomish Touch","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"You touch an Object and reveal any Magical Properties on it. Additionally, you can make an Academics Check to appraise the item and determine its approximate value.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"6_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"15835a50e1e9447a","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Squeeze By","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You take a modified version of the Move Action that allows you to pass through any Creature without provoking Reactions, as long as your Movement ends within an unoccupied space. Additionally, you can fit through tight spaces as if you were one size Smaller.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"9_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"6d3758e261a7422f","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Giant Toss","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Make a Shove Attack against a Creature smaller than you, throwing them 4 Units and knocking them Prone. If the Creature collides with another Creature in their path, they are treated as a Projectile with your initial Strength Check being used as the Attack Roll. If the Creatures collide, they both take Physical Damage equal to your Strength Bonus Modifier.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"8_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4846c70cfc084482","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Human Destiny","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You immediately enter Lifeline but gain 12 Lifeline Points. If combat ends before you die, you gain Health equal to your Level.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"7_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"c24e5610b40f410e","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Play Dead","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to taking Damage, you fall Prone and convincingly play dead. A Creature cannot deduce that you are alive unless making a Contested Insight Check against your Performance.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"12_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"af969993786645aa","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Snapjaw","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make an Unarmed Attack and bite a Creature, doubling your Damage Bonus Modifier. A Creature hit by this Attack must make a Resilience Check greater than or equal to Half the damage after Mitigations or they gain the Bleeding Condition.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"3_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f2ce2188c9da40c0","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Bullcharge","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If you use at least 4 Units of Movement Speed, you can make a special Shove Action, that if successful, deals Physical Damage equal to your Contested Strength Check made on the Shove Attack.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"15_a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f9255f6a4ed04635","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Resilience","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"If you are capable of taking an Action, you can shrug off Grapples, Dazes, Confusion, Blinds, Deafens, Poisons, and being Afraid, gaining 1d4 Health for each one removed.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"5_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"b86c2e406ad340b7","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Quick Hop","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You take the Jump Action but avoid any Attacks of Opportunity. Instead of Jumping a distance, you can also elect to remove any Prone Condition.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"4_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"8faf0b30f63a4a48","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
