{"name":"Third Eye","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You unleash the power of your Third Eye towards a Target you can see within 10 Units. For the next minute, this Creature has a -2 Modifier to Resistance Checks provoked by you until the end of your next Turn. This disables your Eye of the Veth until you complete the next Full Rest.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"20_b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f14429580dd94182","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Bond","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You bond to a Creature, increasing the efficiency of your Shield Spells when used on them, adding additional Shielding equal to your Level. You can only be bound to one Creature at a time.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"100_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"b01bb2b632db44bd","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
