{"name":"Absolute Faith","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to making a Resistance or Resilience Check, gain a 1d4 Bonus. If the Bonus was the cause of a success, gain Temporary Health equal to your Level until the end of your next Full Rest. If you have the Brothers and Sisters trait, you can use this on any eligble member of your Sect within 6 Units.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"230_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"84ed2a4275484e0f","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Rolling Dodge","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Gain +1 Dodge until the start of your next turn. Each time you Dodge an Attack successfully, gain another +1 Dodge until the start of your next turn","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"250_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"81a4fbeb021d485a","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
