{"name":"Reality Surge","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Whenever you would take your next Action, gain 1d4 Actions instead. When you roll a 4, you gain 1 Tier of Exhaustion after the Actions end.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"106_10a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"cc0ef523f64a4db8","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
