{"name":"Windup","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You prepare a vicious strike, winding up for a powerful blow. Until the end of your turn, you cannot Move but gain a +1d4 Bonus on your next Attack with a Unarmed or Melee Weapon. If that attack hits, it is upgraded to a Brutal Critical.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"224_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"c6c72cf53b0c4126","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Pummel","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you score a True Hit on a Creature, roll a Contested Athletics Check against their Resilience. On a failure, the Creature becomes Stunned.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"231_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"63d136315c2f4ac4","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Shieldbreaker","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Make an Attack with a Melee Weapon with a 1d4 Bonus Modifier. If your Attack hits, the affected Creature has a Penalty to their next Block Check before the start of their next turn equal to the result of the d4.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"231_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"9e9473e2677f4dbc","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Hold the Line","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Your Movement Speed becomes 0. You can maintain this indefinitely until you are Knocked Prone, or Stunned.  It costs 1 Action per turn to round the line, otherwise the effect ends.  While this ability is active, hostile Creatures cannot pass through an area in a 1 Unit radius around you.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"253_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"44caf9b5f1044a60","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Shield Charge","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You Move up to your Movement Speed, but at least 4 Units towards a Creature and make a Shove Attack. If successful, the Creature takes 1d6 Fall Damage and lands prone 1 Unit behind you.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"253_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"75d16cdb8ae34f0a","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Critical Block","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you roll a 12 on a Block Check, the Attack misses, regardless of the enemy roll. Additionally, if the Creature that Attacked you is within your Melee Range, you can make a counter Attack with a 1-Handed Weapon that is upgraded to a True Hit if it hits.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"253_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"99685aa9565e4bde","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"As One","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You control your Mount with a Free Action instead of an Action, allowing it to use two actions.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"221_1"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"c062410dba5c43d6","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
