{"name":"Faith in Allies","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"If you are at 0 Health, you can use your Reaction, regardless of limitations, to immediately grant up to 3 Allies within 10 Units a Heroic Action.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"101_6b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"8a3ac6c5877f45b8","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Celestial Wings","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You sprout Celestial Wings, granting you a Fly Speed of 6 for the next Hour. While you fly in this way, you must spend at least 1 Move Action per Round or you will begin falling.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"101_10a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"232ea04712bd4718","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Immobile","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to being Shoved or Displaced, you catch yourself by jamming a Piercing Weapon into the ground, a Mounted Creature or other surface, preventing any Movement. This Reaction can also be used while Falling if there is a parallel wall or terrain within your Melee Reach.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"228_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"5b627932facc44ba","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Spear Plunge","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Directly after using the Jump Action, you crash into the ground making an Attack with a 2 Handed Piercing Weapon against all Creatures within your Melee Range. The Damage for this Attack is equal to 1d4 for each Unit of your Jump. If this Attack is against a Creature that is 2 Sizes larger than you, you automatically Mount it if it takes Damage after Mitgations.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"228_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"72575062c85b4d24","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
