{"name":"Disengaging Strike","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make an Attack with only your Offhand, using your Primary Weapon to fend off Attacks, granting you a +2 Dodge and Block until the end of your turn and allowing you to Immedietly move 3 Units.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"264_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"afd16a77cebc4420","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
