{"name":"Parry","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"After a Creature makes a Melee Attack roll on you or against a Creature that is Adjacent to you, roll a 1d4 subtract that amount from the Attack Check.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"202_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"0fa50cde47654cc2","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Make Space","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If there are two or more enemies adjacent to you, make a sweeping Attack, making a single roll against all adjacent targets. You can immediately move 2 units without provoking Reactions.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"202_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"d87bd78dad2544ca","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Challenge","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You use your Focus issue a challenge to to a Creature, causing your Attacks to deal an extra 1d8 Damage.  This effect persists until someone other than you does Damage to this Creature. This Focus cannot be broken by taking damage.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"202_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"828aa5e8513e4523","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Purify Elements","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You fire a piece of Ammunition with the Elemental Infusion on it, converting all of the Primary Damage to the Damage Type of your Infusion.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"214_2b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"ef77a591690e4b24","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Lineshot","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You fire a piece of Ammunition Infused with one of the Area Infusions (Shocking,Shockwave,Burning,Frosted), converting them into a Line with a Radius of 1 Unit and Length equal to your Ammocraft Modifier at the time of Crafting. Additionally, the Area persists until the end of your next turn, causing any Creature who moves through the affected Area to have to make the Check against the effects again.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"214_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"98d003d3086a4ca3","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Bladedancing","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"As part of the Elven culture, you have perfected the Bladedancer form. Make an Attack with a Slashing Weapon and gain a 1d4 Bonus to Dodge Checks until the start of your next turn.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"10_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"51baa1c59b974426","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Telepathy","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You can speak into another Creatures mind that is within 10 units of you using your choice of Language. Magical Languages extend this Distance to 20 Units.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"225_1"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"46455253367c4484","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Mind Aura","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You reach out in an area with a radius equal to your level. You can sense the minds of any Humanoid or Beast and have a vague idea of their intent such as if they are hostile, scared or friendly.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"225_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"9e812d95977c499f","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Empathy","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When an Ally within 10 Units of you that you have Line of Sight on takes Physical or Psychic Damage, you can shield their mind with yours and split the Damage in half before applying Mitigation, with you taking one half, and your ally the other.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"225_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"a77469f99a9c4762","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Mindreader","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You attempt to read the mind of a Creature that speaks a Language you understand by making a Contested Insight Check against their Resistance. On a success, you can read the most immediate thoughts of the Creature. Additionally, you can elect to deal psychic damage to them equal to twice your Level. On a failure, the Creature is aware that you are attempting to read their mind and you take Psychic Damage equal to the value of their Resistance Check and you cannot use this ability again until you take a Breather.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"225_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"002052bc45b14e35","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Undermine","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You interact with an Object or Structure, examining it for weaknesses by making an Engineering Check. On an 11 or higher, you lower the Durability Tier by 1 for a minute. You can only attempt to Undermine a unique Object or Structure once per Day.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"128_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"ead3e24ad419428b","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
