{"name":"Elemental Charge","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You charge an Evocation Spell with a Subschool using one Power. Until your next Full Rest, you are not able to Channel Spells from other Evocation Subschools.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"103_2b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"bb048e5834b9411d","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Absorb Energy","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to taking Elemental Damage, you empower your Conduit. The next Evocation Spell you Channel before the end of your next turn is automatically Charged and takes 2 less Power.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"103_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"bb192290561f4442","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Elemental Weapon","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you deal Elemental Damage using an Evocation Spell, you can make an Attack with a Light or Ultra-Light Weapon. If you hit your Target, the Primary Damage on the weapon is converted to the same type of Damage as your Channeled Spell.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"103_6a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"c3bd46aeaf294ceb","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
