{"name":"Exploit Weakness","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If you deal Damage to a Creature as part of an Action, you can Learn its Mitigation to Damage Type(s) you did. If that Mitigation is less than your Academics Modifier, the next time your Target takes Damage of that Type before the start of your next turn they take an additional 1d8 Damage. If you possess an Object belonging to the Creatures culture, religion or nation that is at least 100 Years old, the Damage becomes 1d8 + your Academics Modifier. ","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"247_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4cad2ad349374715","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Challenge","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Until the Start of your next turn, any Creature within your Area of Control that Attacks a Creature other than you, suffers a 1d4 Penalty to the first Melee or Weapon attack they make on their turn.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"274_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"3d31bb1c36d94639","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
