{"name":"Condemn","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You declare an Attack against a Creature, and then make that Attack with a +2 Bonus as part of the same Action. If you deal Damage to the Creature, you gain a 1d4 Bonus on your next Attack or Defense Check before the start of your next turn. If you miss, the Creature has a 1d4 Bonus to the next Attack or Defense Check it makes against you.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"251_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"566bd95e75f4420c","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Trial By Fire","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If a Creature has dealt Dark Damage, is a Dark Creature or has Channeled a Necromancy, Fiend or Witchcraft Spell within the past minute, you can force a Contested Insight Check against their Persuasion. On a success, the Target takes Fire Damage equal to the total value of your Insight Check. This ability can be used without the prerequisites when you True Hit any Creature with an Action.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"251_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"531120e162c44684","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Deduction","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You attempt to read a Creatures body language and predict their most likely move by rolling a Contested Insight Check against their Performance. On a success, you gain a 1d4 Bonus to any Defensive Check you make against that Creature until the start of your next turn. This ability does not work on Beasts or Constructs.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"249_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"afdc442413a74262","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
