{"name":"Calming Pheromones","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"For 5 turns, you emit pheromones in a 3-unit radius. At the start of their turn, humanoids and beasts within the area must make a contested Resilience check against 1d12 + half your level. On a failure, they cannot act aggressively unless they or their allies are harmed or threatened. A successful check grants immunity until their next full rest. Additionally, Gain +1d4 to social checks against affected creatures.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"28_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"03436527190e479f","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Orchestrate","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You telepathically coordinate an action with an allied creature within 8 units that is under the effect of your Party Link trait. You coordinate one of the following actions: Use, Attack, Shove.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"28_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"a2f91eb28add463c","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
