{"name":"Agitating Pheromones","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"You release pheromones within a radius equal to half your level that affects all Monsters, Beasts and Humanoids within the area who are not under the effect of your Party Link trait. Each creature must make a Resilience Check against 1d12 plus half your level or become either Maddened or Confused, which you must specifiy before using this ability.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"28_8b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"d2644c39a53b4034","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Hive Recruiter","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"You attempt to bring a humanoid under the effect of your party link closer to the hivemind by making a 1d12 check plus half your level against their resilience modifier. If successful, they are charmed by you until the end of your next full rest. If you successfully charm this humanoid three days in a row, they are absorbed into the hive.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"28_9"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"6e0e57195a6440f7","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
