{"name":"To the Death","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make a Persuasion Check and drop into Lifeline, gaining Lifeline Points equal to your Check to a maximum of 12. Allied Creature who can hear you within 8 Units are not affected by the penalties associated with Lifeline until they reach 1 Lifeline Point. This lasts until you are no longer in Lifeline or fall Unconscious. If an Enemy dies within 8 Units of an Ally, all allies within that Radius gain 1 Lifeline Point.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"215_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"0e2203a76ded4b41","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
