{"name":"Lycanthrope Bite","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"While in Lycanthrope form, You make an Unarmed Attack against a Creature that deals an additional 1d10 Physical Damage. A Creature must make a Resilience Check against the total Physical Damage dealt after Mitigation or become Diseased. If the Disease Creature is a Humanoid and they are not cured within 1d20 days, they are inflicted with Lycanthropy.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"122_a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"c3b8cbcdf50c453e","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Suppress","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make a Sonic Attack at a Creature within 3 Units by making a Contested Check using your Arcanum against their Concentration. On a success, your Target has a 1d4 Penalty to all Spell Attacks until the start of your next turn.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"211_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4758356f8c6a497e","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Mageslayer","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to a Creature Channeling a Spell within 3 Units that you have an unobstructed path to, you Move within your Melee Range and make a Melee Attack against them, dealing Bonus Damage equal to your Arcanum Bonus Modifier. The Creature must then make a Concentration Check to maintain Focus, or the Spell fails.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"211_2b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"7cd4bb3148814bdd","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Spellfist Charge","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you Channel a Ray, Projectile or Melee Attack Spell using your Spellfist Conduit it becomes Charged.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"279_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f3e799c487b9474a","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Hyperfocus","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to making a Concentration Check from taking Damage while Focusing on a Spell, gain a 1d4 Bonus to that Check. If you successfully maintain Focus, gain a Bonus to any Defense Checks until the start of your next turn equal to the result of the d4.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"201_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4f36d4315166455b","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Interception","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to a Creature making a Projectile or Ray Attack that travels within 10 Units of you, you Channel a Projectile or Ray Spell that takes 1 Action. Roll a 1d12 and add a +2 Bonus for each Level of the Spell you Channeled. If your Roll is greater than the initial Attack Roll, the Projectile or Ray is destroyed and does not reach its Target.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"201_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"a8954aa619704393","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Stabilize","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You quickly apply a Sterile Bandage to a Creature, ending any Bleeding Condition and causing them to not lose Lifeline Points at the end of their turn while in Lifeline unless they take Damage.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"123_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"807271bfd4144790","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Resuscitate","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If a Humanoid has been dead for less than 1 minute and is not missing any vital organs, you can attempt to revive them with a Cumulative Medicine Check of 28 over 3 Checks","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"123_6a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"cce0630dec724ab6","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Bloodletting","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Using a blade, you give a Creature the Bleeding Condition by making a small cut. If this is used in a hostile way, make a normal Attack with a Light Piercing or Slashing Weapon and foce the Target to make a Resilience Check against the Physical Damage dealt after Mitigation. If the Creature Bleeds for 4 turns, they are cured of any Disease or Poison affecting them.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"123_6b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4bbd7c0624664903","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Damage Control","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Using your knowledge of Medicine and Anatomy, when you take Physical Damage, you can reduce it by half before applying Mitigations.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"123_8a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"a98ce5e3ed2840d3","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Improvise","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You use your Melodic Conduit to Channel a Beginner or Novice Spell that requires your Focus without spending any Power or requiring you to be able to speak.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"212_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"137a44eb0905483e","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Powerchord","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If you are currently Focusing on playing a Ballad, you play a powerful note on your instrument, causing the next Spell you complete Channeling on this turn to be Charged.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"212_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"6cf96ee3e45549d0","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Blood Fury","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to being the Target of a True Hit that deals Physical Damage, you enter a Blood Fury until you make your next Melee Attack. If the Attack hits, it is automatically upgraded to a True Hit. Until you make that Attack, you automatically fail all Defense Checks.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"15_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"ded332cdcc574ddd","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Palm Strike","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"After hitting a Creature with a Melee Attack, make an Unarmed Strike against the same Creature that deals no Damage against a contested Concentration Check. On a failure, the Target becomes Dazed until the end of their next Turn. On a True Hit, the Creature becomes Stunned.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"241_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f4aaa4efa6ba4b11","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Flying Kick","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make a leaping Unarmed Strike moving up to 3 Units towards a Creature using your Acrobatics Modifier as the Attack Check. If the Attack hits, it deals Physical Damage equal to the result of your Check.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"241_2b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"9e6bd486606c425b","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Resilient Soul","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"In response to being the Target of an Attack, halve the Damage before applying mitigation. If the resulting Damage brings you to 0 Health, gain 1 Health instead. Additionally, you Gain Temorary Health equal to twice your Level that lasts for 1 minute.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"241_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"e65ad3c4ed0c4314","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Devastate","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If you have Moved at least 4 Units on a turn, you can make a Melee Attack dealing bonus Damage equal to the distance in Units you moved. If the Target is a Monster or Beast, this bonus is doubled.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"205_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"cc47c14ca25744be","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Monster Harvest","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make an Attack with a Spell or Weapon. If this Attack brings a Creature to 8 or less Health, the Monster is executed. You gain Permanent Temporary Heath that recharges after each Full Rest equal to the Level of the Monster you killed. Other effects that grant Temporary Health no longer work on you.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"205_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"0f9f4c09110d433b","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
