{"name":"Trained against Darkness","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to taking Dark Damage, reduce the amount by double your Level. If all the Dark Damage was Mitigated, gain Temporary Health equal to your Level until the end of your next turn.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"4_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"70fd8400d7c34dc4","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Infused Weapon","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make a Weapon Attack but convert the Primary Damage to Arcane Damage. If you are fully aligned with your Patron, you gain a 1d4 Bonus to your Attack Roll.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"124_6a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"8ad5714aca324ca4","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Infused Spell","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You Charge a Spell from your Patron's school of magic. If you are not fully aligned with your Patron, your Spell Attack has a 1d4 penalty.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"124_6b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"9cc38fbb09874cb4","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Planar Defense","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to being targeted by an Attack, make a Persuasion Check instead of your normal Defense Check. On a success, your Patron defends you from the Attack and you take no Damage.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"124_8b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4e1e5d1efa2f4f4e","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Favor of the Patron","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"In response to making any Skill Check, add 2d4 to the result. This is decreased to a 1d4 if you have negative alignment with your Patron and does not add any bonus if you have -3 alignment.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"124_a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"907f1a3ff6eb4d42","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Reckless Onslaught","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You leap up to your Jump distance. If your next Melee Attack hits on this turn, it is upgraded to a True Hit. Until the start of your next turn, the first Melee Attack that hits you is also upgraded to a True Hit.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"283_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"94b1207f027f4e1c","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Anguishing Strike","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make an Attack with a melee weapon that deals an additional 1d8 Primary Damage if you are below your Maximum Health. This bonus is increaesd to 2d8 when below half your Maximum Health, and 4d8 while in lifeline.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"283_2b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"ef3c3108c7e74b67","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Pain Threshold","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to taking Damage, make a Resilience Check and reduce the damage by that amount. If you are below half your maximum Health before taking the damage, this does not count against your unique Reaction limit.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"283_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"bccfcbf4494f48e1","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
