{"name":"Shadowspawn","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"You detach your shadow in an unoccupied area adjacent to you. It becomes a dark creature with health equal to double your level while sharing the same mitigations and movement speed as you. You can use a subsequent action to recall or deploy your shadow unless it reaches 0 health. The shadow acts on your Initiative and has one Action which it can only use to either Move or Attack with a Melee Weapon you have equipped. The shadow is immune to all conditions and has a size equal to your own.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"255_1"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"41cb111acca0460e","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Swap","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to either you or your Shadow being the target of an Attack, swap places causing the attack to be redirected. If your new position places you adjacent to a creature, you can make a Melee Attack against it.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"255_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"6fd79ce9b5364cf9","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
