{"name":"Vault","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If you have used the Move Action on your turn, you can make vaulting Attack against a Creature within 3 Units that has a +2 Attack Bonus while you have a 2-Handed Weapon equipped.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"265_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"82c1b012b4bc480b","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Deflect Blow","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When a Melee Attack is made against you, you can make a Weapon Attack instead of a Block or Dodge Check. If successful, you can redirect the Attack to another Creature that is within reach of the Attacker. This Attack has a -2 Modifier to hit the new target.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"265_2b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"60316cc8c9a3474d","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
