{"name":"Flank","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When an Allied Creature makes a Melee Attack against a target within your Melee Range, you can make an Attack against that same target with a 1d4 Bonus.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"133_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"d3df16d7ea13442b","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Uppercut","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make a strong Unarmed Strike against a Creature, putting your full force into the blow and adding your Strength Bonus Modifier to the Damage. On a True Hit, the Strength Bonus is doubled.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"133_6a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"22d71389bc8b4081","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Counter","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to being the Target of a Melee Attack, use your Athletics Skill in place of your Defense Check. If the Attack misses, the Creature must make an Athletics or Acrobatics Check against your Defense Check, or fall Prone.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"133_6b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"a5560f7483fe453f","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Fatal Force","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Roll a 1d4 and make a number of Unarmed Strikes against a Target equal to the result","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"133_10b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"13b92c68d6b048a0","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Greater Summoning","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Instead of using a quartz worth 5gp and an action, you can utilize a beginner catalyst gem to summon the corresponding elemental. When summoned this way, the elemental gains Temporary Health equal to your level. This ability can also be used to summon a higher level elemental using the Master Summoner trait with the appropriate catalyst.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"281_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"578c75c675aa48c6","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Divert Elements","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to taking elemental, arcane or physical damage when you have an active summon, you add their mitigation to yours when calculating damage.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"281_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"31cab062c6fd42fc","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Focused Elements","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you have an active elemental and channel an evocation spell of the subschool of your elemental, it becomes charged, has it's true hit threshold increased and can critically hit.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"281_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4dc1f2e77bb64397","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Feign Death","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to a Creature making an Attack against you, make a Performance Check to pretend that you have died. Any Creature with a Persistent Insight Check higher than your Performance Checks can tell that you are feigning, otherwise you are believed to be dead.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"218_2a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"923c9aaef6424b73","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Mocking Taunt","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to a Creature starting their turn within 4 Units of you, make a Performance Check against their Insight. If it fails, the Creature has a 1d4 Penalty to Attack Checks against any Target other than you. This does not work on Beasts, Constructs or Creatures without the ability to make Insight Checks.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"218_2b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f952ba1af164442a","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
