{"name":"Encore!","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"After rolling a True Hit on a Creature with an Attack, make a different type of Attack on the same Creature such as a Spell after using a Melee Attack or an Attack with a Ranged Weapon after hitting with a Melee Weapon. If the Target dies as a result of this Attack, you gain a Heroic Action.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"218_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"35e7da7fb2fe4617","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Pocket Sand","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You toss either debris from your pocket or dirt from the ground at a Creature within 2 Units by making a Contested Thievery Check against their Initiative. On a success, the Creature is Blinded until the end of your turn and cannot take Reactions unless they have another sense to locate you by such as Echolocation or Tremorsense.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"219_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"4799ddd2d69b48ba","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Quick Hide","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you use an Action to Move, you can also Hide as part of that Action if no Enemy Creatures have Line of Sight on you.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"219_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"b4e4208b0c10421d","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
