{"name":"Versatile Reaction","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You can use one of your unique Reactions without expending one of its charges.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"116_10b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f450a4f7ed3c4cb9","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Detatchable Parts","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You detatch either a hand or eyeball from your body. When the hand is detatched in this way, it takes on the Undead Hand Statblock which you control. An eye detatched in this way grants you Sight in a 4 unit radius from the location of the eyeball when it is less than 100 Units away. A body part can be reattached by using this Action again.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"29_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"7a8abdaad3164694","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Undead Fortitude","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"In response to being the target of an ability that requires you to make a Resilience or Resistance Check, gain a 1d6 Bonus to your roll. If the resulting ability deals Psychic Damage, that damage is halved before applying mitigations.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"29_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"bd00ae3e2d0a4a36","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Tainted Bile","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You smear a Weapon with bile, tainting it for the next Attack you take before the end of your turn. When you deal Physical Damage with this Weapon, the creature must make a Resilience Check against the total damage dealt after Mitigation or they get a modified version of the Poisoned Condition which deals 2d4 Dark Damage and prevents a Creature from recovering Health while affected.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"29_6a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"ea38a00ceabf46d1","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Banshee Scream","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"You unleash a wave of sonic energy in a 4 Unit Radius dealing 1d4 Dark Damage per Level. Humanoids and Beasts that are lower Level than you become Afraid until the end of your next turn.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"29_6b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"76b701ef4fe64d15","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Still As Death","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"In response to taking Damage, you fall down in a heap, indistinguishable from real death. After 1 Minute, you recover half of your maximum Health.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"29_a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"6be6e2b792e74d6b","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Bat Swarm","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You turn into a Swarm of Bats for up to 1 Hour, inheriting their Statblock. The Swarm only recovers Health at the end of a Full Rest and if it reaches 0, you cannot use this Action again until the swarm is restored. You revert back to your original form if the swarm reaches 0 Health or you use this Action again.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"120_6b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"0c50ccd074e64b2b","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Regeneration","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"After consuming blood from a Humanoid or Beast, either with the Vampire Bite Action or drinking from a container, you gain 2d4 Health. After using this ability, your blood requirements are no longer satisifed for the day.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"120_7"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"1524c8435a9140a8","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Vampire Bite","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"You make an Unarmed Attack against another Creature. If the Target is a Beast or Humanoid and the Damage is not completely Mitigated, you gain Health equal to the damage dealt and have your blood requirements satisifed.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"120_a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"22f4677dd07449e2","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Antimagic","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":true,"description":"In response to a Spell being Channeled within a number of Units equal to your Level, lower the Spell Attack by 1d8. If the Spell does not require a Spell Attack, the Spell fails if the result of the d8 is 6 or higher.","uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"avd12_id":"20_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"577fa77d73ed4597","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Parody","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When an Attack misses you or an Ally within your Ballad Range, you can use your Reaction to sing or play a quick parody about that Creature, causing them to have a 1d4 Penalty on their next Attack or Defense Check.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"220_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"9dca60e2010745c4","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Spell Surge","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"After Channeling a Spell that has a Channel Time of 1 Action and has an Attack Roll, amplify it with a surge of magic increasing your Check by 1d4. In the event you roll a 1, you roll on the Surge Table which alters your Spell.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"238_1"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"015d738abf194fae","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Empowering Surge","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"After a Creature within 10 Units Channels a Spell with a Channel Type of 1 Action, you amplify it with a surge of magic increasing your Check by 1d4. In the event you roll a 1, you roll on the Surge Table which alters your Spell.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"238_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"f90cf1fa64684053","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Hex","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Mark a Creature that you can see within 15 Units and curse them with a Hex that lasts for 1 minute. Any time you hit a Creature with a new Spell or Weapon Attack, you deal extra 1d8 (2d8 if Improved) Dark Damage. Hex can only be used again if the Hexed Creature dies, otherwise, you must wait until you finish a Full Rest to use this ability again.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"105_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"a6b4648bbe984e7a","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Dark Stalker","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"If you start your turn in Darkness, gain a +2 Attack on all Spells and Weapons until the end of your turn.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"105_8a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"cfd2a5a118d144cf","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Transfer Spell","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When a Creature dies that is affected by one of your Spells that you are maintaining Focus on, you can use a Reaction to move that Spell to another Creature by making a Spell Attack against their Resistance. On a failure, the Spell ends.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"105_8b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"88780b8486a9405c","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Powershove","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you make a successful Shove Action, you both displace and knock the creature Prone instead of choosing between the two.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"258_4a"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"904caec9e57245b4","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Reversal","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When a Creature attempts to Shove or Grapple you, gain a 1d4 Bonus to your roll. If you win the Check, you can choose to Shove or Grapple the Creature.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"258_4b"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"151b97420cf74dac","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Slam","type":"action","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you have a target Grappled or are adjacent to a target that is Prone, you make an Unarmed Attack on them that is upgraded to a Brutal Critical if it hits.","uses":{"current":3,"max":3},"avd12_id":"258_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"221455e74bac45b0","folder":"8f0646a847504190","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Reward the Faithful","type":"freeaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"When you get a True hit on any Attack on a Creature that is at most 2 Levels lower than you, gain Temporary Health equal to your Level that lasts until expended or the end of a Full Rest.","uses":{"current":0,"max":0},"avd12_id":"277_3"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"8e2666213b1b4358","folder":"61f74e9ee4ba4778","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}
{"name":"Enduring Faith","type":"reaction","img":"systems/avd12/images/icons/focus2.webp","system":{"daily":false,"description":"Whenever you are forced to make either a Concentration, Resilience or Resistance Check, add an additional 1d6 to the total. This ability can be used after the result of the roll is known.","uses":{"current":2,"max":2},"avd12_id":"277_5"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":""}},"_stats":{"systemId":"avd12","systemVersion":"14.0.2","coreVersion":"12.324.0","createdTime":1736286701128,"modifiedTime":1736286701128,"lastModifiedBy":"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP"},"_id":"487f9db427c64ade","folder":"d6656fd454944b77","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"PkSjA89Pm9zyORjP":3}}